// Power Help Text :
"P3835026890" "You placate a foe, convincing them to break off their attacks on you. If successful, you will also be hidden from your foes. This stealth effect is very brief and offers no defense bonuses, but it will allow you to set up an attack for a critical strike. If you attack a placated foe, the effect will break, allowing the foe to attack you once more."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P705818675" "You have been placated."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P135371575" "You have been placated by {PlayerSource}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Head Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2240630470" "Golden Dragonfly"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2571382953" "Melee, Extreme DMG (Lethal), -DEF (Foe, All), Chance for Knockdown (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2818835782" "You perform a devastating Golden Dragonfly attack that deals a massive amount of lethal damage and can even knock a foe down to the ground and reduce their Defense. The power of this attack can actually extend a short distance through multiple foes. If executed while hidden, only some affected targets may be hit with a Critical, however, there is a chance you may land a Critical hit with Golden Dragonfly even if you are not Hidden.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2982196974" "The Ninja Blade has reduced your Defenses."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3697274499" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} strike, causing {Damage} points of lethal damage and reducing your defenses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P78341141" "Hide"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3950205672" "Self, Stealth, +DEF(Melee, Ranged, AoE)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3861427166" "You utilize masterful stealth techniques to become almost impossible to detect. When properly hidden, you can pull off critical hits with your attacks. If you attack or are damaged while hidden, the effect will break and you will be unable to set up guaranteed critical strikes, though you will retain your defense bonuses for a short while."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4234907424" "You are concealed by your {PowerName}."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
"P3802943013" "Avoided"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dark Regeneration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1873199416" "Dark Regeneration"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3460036964" "PBAoE Minor DMG(Negative), Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P2478989529" "You tap the dark essence of the Netherworld to drain a small amount of life through negative energy damage from all enemies nearby, healing yourself in the process. The more foes affected, the more you will be healed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2677880999" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} drains your life essence, causing {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cloak of Fear 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2822656354" "Cloak of Fear"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4212242451" "PBAoE, Terrorize (Foe), -ToHit (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2924129109" "You can wrap yourself in a nightmarish Cloak of Fear. Foes close to you are treated to visions most horrific, forcing them to tremble in terror, only attacking if attacked, and even then, with a reduced chance to hit. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P435927884" "Terrorize"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1178800418" "You are terrorized."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2147086723" "You have been terrorized by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} and suffer a reduced chance to hit."

// ******************************************************************************** 
