// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P372881666" "Single Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1671704698" "Ranged, Moderate DMG (Energy), Minor DoT (Energy), -Regen (Foe), Chance for Knockdown (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1165554890" "You fire a single blast from your Beam Rifle, causing energy damage and lowering your target's regeneration. The target will also suffer minor energy damage over time. There is also a chance the target may be knocked down."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3150127817" "-Regen"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4258802996" "Your regeneration has been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P560880847" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and lowers your regeneration."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1211707216" "You suffer an additional {Damage} points of energy damage due to the lingering effects of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1295646782" "Charged Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2312193107" "Ranged, High DMG (Energy), Minor DoT (Energy), -Rec (Foe), Chance for Knockdown (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3829110803" "You charge up your beam rifle to launch a concentrated blast of energy at your foe, causing energy damage and lowering recovery. The target will also suffer minor energy damage over time. There is also a chance that your target will be knocked down by the blast."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3491101985" "-Rec"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4109065789" "Your recovery has been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P546366764" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and lowers your recovery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cutting Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P290039893" "Cutting Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1383109576" "Ranged (Cone), High DMG (Energy), -DEF (Foe, All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P388839584" "You fire a steady beam of energy from your beam rifle, sweeping it in a broad arc across the foes in front of you. This causes energy damage to all affected targets, as well as a reduction in defense. There is also a chance that an affected target will suffer additional energy damage over time due to the lingering effects of the energy beam."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1401109544" "-DEF (All), Chance for DoT (Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P127281341" "Your defenses have been reduced and you may be suffering energy damage over time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3789028239" "{PlayerSource} sears you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and lowers your defenses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Piercing Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4113413988" "Piercing Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3575853125" "Ranged (Narrow Cone), Superior DMG (Energy), -RES (Foe, All), Chance for Moderate DoT (Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2534786663" "You fire a supercharged beam of energy in a narrow cone that pierces through up to 3 enemies. Affected targets suffer energy damage and reduced resistance to all types of damage. There is a chance that affected targets will also suffer additional energy damage over time due to the lingering effects of the beam."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P808563286" "-RES (All), Chance for DoT (Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2967141893" "Your resistance to all forms of damage has been reduced. You may also be suffering energy damage over time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3760172651" "{PlayerSource} sears you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and lowers your resistances."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Overcharge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
