"P148366414" "Overcharge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P927305478" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Extreme DMG(Energy), Minor DoT (Energy), -DEF (Foe, All), Chance for Stun (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P710032337" "You overcharge your beam rifle, releasing the energy in a massive beam at a group of distant foes. Affected targets suffer energy damage, with a small amount of lingering energy damage over time, along with reduction in their defense. There is also a high chance that for an affected target to be stunned."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3830594336" "DoT (Energy), -DEF (All), Chance for Stun"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3271523390" "Your defenses have been reduced and you are suffering energy damage over time. There is also a chance you may be stunned."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4191899424" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with an {PowerName} beam, causing {Damage} points of energy damage and greatly reducing your defense."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2807432503" "You have been stunned by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Grenade 
