"P3189667928" "Web Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P116238448" "Ranged, Immobilize (Foe), -Speed (Foe, All), -Rech (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3991651859" "You throw a grenade at a single target. On impact, this grenade expels as a strong, sticky gel that can can immobilize most targets and prevent flight. The target will also suffer reductions in their movement and attack speeds."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P202299694" "Immobilize, -Speed (All), -Rech, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P286514573" "You are immobilized and cannot move or fly. Your movement and attack speeds are also reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4048388681" "You have been immobilized by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} and suffer lingering reduction to your movement and attack speeds."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
