"P810634828" "Smoke Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P554635984" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), -Perception (Foe), -ToHit (Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P993168784" "You throw a grenade at a single target. On impact, this grenade expels as a thick smoke that obscures a small area. This reduces the perception and chance to hit for all targets caught within the area of effect."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3070891156" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} slightly reducing their chance to hit and dramatically reducing their perception!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P503998744" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName} slightly decreasing your chance to hit and dramatically reducing your perception!"
