// Power Help Text :
"P2452651002" "You cause a powerful geyser of scalding hot water to erupt from within the earth, burning your foes and tossing them into the air. Affected targets suffer fire damage and are knocked into the air, while also suffering smashing damage and reduced movement speeds upon falling back to the ground. There is a chance that the fall could also leave affected targets stunned."
